  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><section class=\"relative bg-racing-900 text-white overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"><video src=\"/assets/aurora-a78de3e2.webm\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" autoplay=\"1\" loop=\"1\" playsinline=\"1\"></video><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-racing-900/90\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 container mx-auto px-4 py-8 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight animate-fade-in\">Versteigern Sie Ihr Liebhaberfahrzeug oder Motorrad.</h1><div class=\"trustpilot-widget mb-4\" data-locale=\"de-DE\" data-template-id=\"5419b732fbfb950b10de65e5\" data-businessunit-id=\"62386e172adef886c504f06e\" data-style-height=\"24px\" data-style-width=\"100%\" data-theme=\"dark\" data-token=\"40741a57-c542-4486-88c8-250259092c7c\" data-min-review-count=\"0\" data-style-alignment=\"center\"><a href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/biddershighway.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Trustpilot</a></div><div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8 py-4 lg:py-6 border border-white/20\"><h3 class=\"mb-4\">Verkaufen Sie in sieben Tagen mit niedriger Verkäufergebühr - füllen Sie die Felder unten aus.</h3><tracking-controller><form data-props=\"{}\" data-action=\"tracking#register\" data-event=\"seller_apply\" data-title=\"main_form\" class=\"space-y-4\" id=\"new_lead\" action=\"/de/sales_inquiries\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\" method=\"post\"><input name=\"lead[accept_terms]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\" autocomplete=\"off\"><input class=\"absolute -z-10\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\" name=\"lead[accept_terms]\" id=\"lead_accept_terms\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"flex\"><div class=\"rounded-l-md overflow-hidden bg-blue-700 flex items-center px-1\"><img src=\"/assets/reg-plate-d7f5d504.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"w-4 md:w-5\"></div><input placeholder=\"Autokennzeichen\" class=\"border-2 border-stone-300 bg-white text-base py-2 md:py-3 px-5 focus:border-jaffa focus:ring-2 focus:ring-jaffa/20 transition-all placeholder:text-stone-400 w-full rounded-r-md\" required=\"required\" type=\"text\" name=\"lead[registration_number]\" id=\"lead_registration_number\"></div><input placeholder=\"E-Mail\" class=\"border-2 border-stone-300 bg-white text-base py-2 md:py-3 px-5 focus:border-jaffa focus:ring-2 focus:ring-jaffa/20 transition-all placeholder:text-stone-400 w-full rounded-md\" autocomplete=\"email\" required=\"required\" type=\"email\" name=\"lead[email]\" id=\"lead_email\"><input placeholder=\"Telefonnummer\" class=\"border-2 border-stone-300 bg-white text-base py-2 md:py-3 px-5 focus:border-jaffa focus:ring-2 focus:ring-jaffa/20 transition-all placeholder:text-stone-400 w-full rounded-md\" type=\"tel\" autocomplete=\"tel\" required=\"required\" name=\"lead[phone]\" id=\"lead_phone\"></div><input autocomplete=\"off\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"seller_apply\" name=\"lead[lead_generator]\" id=\"lead_lead_generator\"><input autocomplete=\"off\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"lead[utm_source]\" id=\"lead_utm_source\"><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><input type=\"submit\" name=\"commit\" value=\"Absenden\" class=\"bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg cursor-pointer transition-all transform shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl w-full sm:w-auto\" data-disable-with=\"Anfrage erstellen\"></div><p class=\"text-xs text-white/80 text-center leading-snug\">Die Interessenanmeldung ist kostenlos und unverbindlich.</p></form></tracking-controller></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3\"><a href=\"/de/collection_leads/new\" class=\"border-2 border-jaffa text-jaffa hover:bg-jaffa hover:text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 inline-block\">Fahrzeugsammlung verkaufen</a><a href=\"/de/estate-sales/new\" class=\"border-2 border-jaffa text-jaffa hover:bg-jaffa hover:text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 inline-block\">Nachlass verkaufen</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white py-4 border-b border-stone-200\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-8 gap-y-4 text-sm text-stone-600\"><div class=\"flex gap-1 items-center\"><span class=\"icon text-racing-700 text-xl\">shield</span><span class=\"font-medium\">BankID-verifiziert</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-1 items-center\"><span class=\"icon text-racing-700 text-xl\">check_circle</span><span class=\"font-medium\">Sichere Auktionsplattform</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-1 items-center\"><span class=\"icon text-racing-700 text-xl\">handshake</span><span class=\"font-medium\">Verifizierte Bieter</span></div></div></div></section><p class=\"text-center text-stone-600 italic max-w-4xl mx-auto my-4 lg:my-8 px-4 leading-relaxed\">Die Auktion ist nachweislich der klügste Weg, um Ihr Liebhaberfahrzeug zu verkaufen - wir haben eine internationale und spezialisierte Reichweite, die den richtigen Käufer zum richtigen Preis findet. Zeitlich begrenzte Gebote über 7 Tage schaffen Dynamik und Kauflust, während professionelle Fotos, Videos und eine gut geschriebene Anzeige die Gebotswilligkeit steigern.</p><section class=\"py-8 lg:py-20 bg-off-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-6 lg:mb-12\">Warum mit uns verkaufen</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 md:text-sm transform hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 bg-jaffa/10 rounded-full mb-6\"><span class=\"icon text-3xl text-jaffa\">star</span></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">Reibungsloser Ablauf</h3><ul class=\"text-left space-y-2 mt-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-x-2 text-stone-700\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-base/0\">check_circle</span></div><span>Das Auto bleibt während der gesamten Auktion zu Hause</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-x-2 text-stone-700\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-base/0\">check_circle</span></div><span>Erreichen Sie 50.000 Liebhaber auf einmal</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-x-2 text-stone-700\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-base/0\">check_circle</span></div><span>Niedrige Gebühr, Foto und Werbung inklusive</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 md:text-sm transform hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 bg-jaffa/10 rounded-full mb-6\"><span class=\"icon text-3xl text-jaffa\">shield</span></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">Sicher &amp; verifiziert</h3><ul class=\"text-left space-y-2 mt-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-x-2 text-stone-700\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-base/0\">check_circle</span></div><span>Niedrige Verkäufergebühr</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-x-2 text-stone-700\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-base/0\">check_circle</span></div><span>Alle Bieter sind mit BankID oder Kreditkartendaten legitimiert</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-x-2 text-stone-700\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-base/0\">check_circle</span></div><span>Alle Kontakte laufen über uns - sicher und reibungslos</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 md:text-sm transform hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 bg-jaffa/10 rounded-full mb-6\"><span class=\"icon text-3xl text-jaffa\">public</span></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">Die richtigen Käufer</h3><ul class=\"text-left space-y-2 mt-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-x-2 text-stone-700\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-base/0\">check_circle</span></div><span>Ihr Fahrzeug erreicht ein engagiertes Publikum von Liebhabern - in Schweden und international</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-x-2 text-stone-700\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-base/0\">check_circle</span></div><span>Verkaufen Sie in sieben Tagen - schnell und einfach</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-8 lg:py-20 bg-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-6 lg:mb-12\">So funktioniert es</h2><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-md flex gap-4 items-stretch\" data-step=\"1\"><div class=\"text-8xl md:text-9xl font-black text-racing-900 leading-none flex-shrink-0 self-stretch flex items-center\">1</div><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Beschreiben Sie Ihr Auto</h3><p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Füllen Sie das Formular aus. Unsere Spezialisten helfen Ihnen zu einem erfolgreichen Verkauf.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-md flex gap-4 items-stretch\" data-step=\"2\"><div class=\"text-8xl md:text-9xl font-black text-racing-900 leading-none flex-shrink-0 self-stretch flex items-center\">2</div><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Mindestpreis festlegen</h3><p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Ihr Fahrzeug wird geschätzt und wir einigen uns auf einen geeigneten Mindestpreis. Wir befragen Sie über den Zustand des Autos, die Geschichte, die Dokumentation und andere relevante Details für die Auktion.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-md flex gap-4 items-stretch\" data-step=\"3\"><div class=\"text-8xl md:text-9xl font-black text-racing-900 leading-none flex-shrink-0 self-stretch flex items-center\">3</div><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Wir erstellen das Inserat</h3><p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Das Auto wird professionell fotografiert und wir schreiben ein attraktives Inserat, das Sie genehmigen. Keine unerwünschten Besucher und Telefonanrufe.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-md flex gap-4 items-stretch\" data-step=\"4\"><div class=\"text-8xl md:text-9xl font-black text-racing-900 leading-none flex-shrink-0 self-stretch flex items-center\">4</div><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Sie erhalten das Ergebnis</h3><p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Die Auktion läuft sieben Tage. Wenn das letzte Gebot den Mindestpreis erreicht, vereinbaren Sie mit dem Käufer Zahlung und Lieferung. Alle Gebote werden gespeichert und mit schwedischer BankID und Kreditkarte verifiziert.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-8 lg:py-20 bg-off-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-6 lg:mb-12\">Was unsere Kunden sagen</h2></div></section><section class=\"py-8 bg-racing-900 text-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"bg-racing-900\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-4 lg:py-6\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"text-center text-off-white\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold\">200 000+</h3><span class=\"text-sm lg:text-base\">Besucher/Monat</span></div><div class=\"text-center text-off-white\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold\">30 000+</h3><span class=\"text-sm lg:text-base\">Registrierte Benutzer</span></div><div class=\"text-center text-off-white\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold\">150+</h3><span class=\"text-sm lg:text-base\">Bilder pro Auktion</span></div><div class=\"text-center text-off-white\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold\">250 Mio. SEK+</h3><span class=\"text-sm lg:text-base\">Gebotvolumen/Monat</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"trustpilot-widget my-2 md:my-6\" data-locale=\"de-DE\" data-template-id=\"5613c9cde69ddc09340c6beb\" data-businessunit-id=\"62386e172adef886c504f06e\" data-style-height=\"100%\" data-style-width=\"100%\" data-theme=\"light\"><a href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/biddershighway.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Trustpilot</a></div><section class=\"py-16 bg-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">Häufig gestellte Fragen</h2><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a href=\"/de/questions/do-you-sell-all-types-of-vehicles_ce6ea8d5-33d7-4846-abe4-a35eeec581da\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-3 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:bg-off-white rounded-lg transition-all group\"><span class=\"text-racing-900 group-hover:text-jaffa transition-colors\">Do you sell all types of vehicles?</span><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-lg flex-shrink-0 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\">arrow_forward</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/de/questions/how-do-i-know-what-my-car-is-worth_bdc5f70a-41f0-40fe-b51e-51606067f611\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-3 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:bg-off-white rounded-lg transition-all group\"><span class=\"text-racing-900 group-hover:text-jaffa transition-colors\">How do I know what my car is worth?</span><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-lg flex-shrink-0 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\">arrow_forward</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/de/questions/can-i-advertise-my-car-on-other-marketplaces-whi